					<p class="text-black text-[9px] sm:text-[13px] md:text-[15px] lg:text-[17px] xl:text-[18px] leading-relaxed">
						I am an incoming 4th year student at Immaculate Conception Institution that is currently taking a Bachelor of Science in Computer Science course. I have multiple experiences in tech related projects including website, application, and game development.
						I have worked with the technologies such as JavaScript, PHP, C#, Java, and Python, ensuring security, reliability and scalability.
						<br><br>
						Currently, I am in the process of learning and developing a hardware related project that includes edge computing. This allows me to always be aligned in the current technology trends and continuously adapt to emerging technologies this modern era offers.
						<br><br>
						Lastly, beyond my programming background, I am also confident in my abilities in terms of digital art creation, video editing, image editing, and 3d asset creation. These skills enhances my ability to develop a more engaging and creative solutions.
					</p>
					<a href="/Resume.pdf"  target="_blank"
						class="bg-black text-[10px] md:text-[18px] w-[150px] px-4 py-2 h-6 md:w-[250px] mt-7 md:py-5 text-white inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-1">
						Download Resume
