							</p> 
							<p class="text-[9px] sm:text-[13px] md:text-[15px] lg:text-[18px]">Cisco</p>
							</a>
						</div>
						
					</div>
				</div>

				<div id="contacts" class="snap-section my-6 sm:my-10 md:my-14 lg:my-20">
    				<h1 class="text-black text-[13px] sm:text-[18px] md:text-[22px] lg:text-[26px] font-bold mb-2 sm:mb-4 md:mb-5">Contacts</h1>

    				<div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-10">
    				    <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/vince-cas/" target="_blank">
